## 2026-11-11 — Paid subscribe did not unlock (ITN)

**For maintainers**
- `omnibible@gmail.com` paid (~R5, order `b34ce1d2…`) but `payfast-webhook` never fulfilled — profile stayed **free**, orders **pending**. Manual grant 30 days + payment_history. Hardened ITN likely 400’d (signature re-encode / missing `m_payment_id`).
